  "prefLabel": "Puc 702.05 Sewage",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 702.05 \"Sewage\" means ground garbage, human or animal excretions and all other waterborne waste normally disposed of by residential, industrial, or commercial facilities through a sanitary sewage disposal system excluding solid waste, industrial waste and septic pumping.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 700) #13889, eff 4-22-24",
